note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a></span></div>"},{"key":"source_locator","html":"Theorem 1.17, pp.14–17, DjVu scans 29–32"},{"key":"source_basis","html":"用户提供的 DjVu 文本层；陈述已核对，技术证明未逐式重验"},{"key":"revision_basis","html":"本次仅据用户提供的29(1).zip修订；既有原书定位及过往核对叙述为继承记录，未重新取得或查看DjVu原件"},{"key":"revision_verification","html":"数学类型与接口审查、静态结构及链接检查；未提交证明助理内核证书"}],"html":"\n<h2 id=\"Hypothesis\">[Hypothesis]</h2>\n<ul>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\tau_{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}},\\tau_{\\leq,+,\\times},\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}},\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,+,\\times}\">\\(\\tau_{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}},\\tau_{\\leq,+,\\times},\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}},\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,+,\\times}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-7\" data-note=\"ca637fd445ff9abd\" href=\"?note=ca637fd445ff9abd\" title=\"29-df-numeric-structures\">29-df-numeric-structures</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau}\">\\(\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-8\" data-note=\"a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" href=\"?note=a3fa1d78e657e6a2\" title=\"29-df-formula\">29-df-formula</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\models\">\\(\\models\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-9\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{BIT}\">\\(\\mathrm{BIT}\\)</span> (see <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-10\" data-note=\"9f29a2487393d5b9\" href=\"?note=9f29a2487393d5b9\" title=\"29-df-bit\">29-df-bit</a>)</p>\n</li>\n<li>\n<p><span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"u,v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(u,v,w\\in\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 两两不同，<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{Var}\">\\(\\mathrm{Var}\\)</span> 与 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"\\mathrm{FV}\">\\(\\mathrm{FV}\\)</span> 分别见 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-11\" data-note=\"ad08b66c5e54a436\" href=\"?note=ad08b66c5e54a436\" title=\"29-df-variable\">29-df-variable</a>、<a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-12\" data-note=\"db2b32546860e623\" href=\"?note=db2b32546860e623\" title=\"29-df-free-variable\">29-df-free-variable</a>；<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"a,b,c,i,j\">\\(a,b,c,i,j\\)</span> 为论域元素。<span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[a,b,c/u,v,w]\">\\([a,b,c/u,v,w]\\)</span> 及 <span class=\"math-inline\" data-tex=\"[i,j/u,v]\">\\([i,j/u,v]\\)</span> 是 <a class=\"wiki-link\" id=\"ref-13\" data-note=\"3ee556c64b16809b\" href=\"?note=3ee556c64b16809b\" title=\"29-df-satisfaction\">29-df-satisfaction</a> 的显式元组赋值接口。</p>\n</li>\n</ul>\n<h2 id=\"Assertion\">[Assertion]</h2>\n<figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\varphi_+,\\varphi_\\times\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_+)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_\\times)\\subseteq\\{u,v,w\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall a,b,c\\in n\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models\\varphi_+[a,b,c/u,v,w]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ a+b=c\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models\\varphi_\\times[a,b,c/u,v,w]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ ab=c\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\varphi_+,\\varphi_\\times\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_+)\\cup\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_\\times)\\subseteq\\{u,v,w\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall a,b,c\\in n\\;\\left[\\begin{aligned}&amp;\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models\\varphi_+[a,b,c/u,v,w]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ a+b=c\\right)\\\\&amp;\\land\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,\\mathrm{BIT}}\\models\\varphi_\\times[a,b,c/u,v,w]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ ab=c\\right)\\end{aligned}\\right]\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><figure class=\"equation\" data-tex=\"\\exists\\varphi_{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\leq,+,\\times}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{BIT}})\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,+,\\times}\\models\\varphi_{\\mathrm{BIT}}[i,j/u,v]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\right)\\right).\"><div class=\"math-display\" tabindex=\"0\" role=\"region\" aria-label=\"数学公式\">\\[\\exists\\varphi_{\\mathrm{BIT}}\\in\\mathrm{Fml}_{\\tau_{\\leq,+,\\times}}\\;\\left(\\mathrm{FV}(\\varphi_{\\mathrm{BIT}})\\subseteq\\{u,v\\}\\land\\forall n\\in\\mathbb N_{\\geq1}\\;\\forall i,j\\in n\\;\\left(\\mathfrak N_n^{\\leq,+,\\times}\\models\\varphi_{\\mathrm{BIT}}[i,j/u,v]\\ \\leftrightarrow\\ \\mathrm{BIT}(i,j)\\right)\\right).\\]</div><button class=\"equation-action\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"展开查看完整公式\">展开公式 ↗</button></figure><h2 id=\"Remark\">[Remark]</h2>\n<p>原书 Theorem 1.17，印刷页 14、扫描页 29，给出含序时 BIT 与 PLUS、TIMES 的互定义。本条只断言固定公式的存在，数值运算取域内截断图关系；各个小域的有限例外可由有限个 FO 分支处理。本次核对陈述和数值域接口，未逐式重验 pp.14–17 的技术证明。</p>\n","headings":[{"id":"Hypothesis","text":"[Hypothesis]","level":2},{"id":"Assertion","text":"[Assertion]","level":2},{"id":"Remark","text":"[Remark]","level":2}],"links":[{"target":"29-df-numeric-structures","status":"resolved","id":"ca637fd445ff9abd","anchor":"ref-1","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-numeric-structures]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-formula","status":"resolved","id":"a3fa1d78e657e6a2","anchor":"ref-2","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-formula]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-satisfaction","status":"resolved","id":"3ee556c64b16809b","anchor":"ref-3","targetAnchor":"","location":"元数据 · depends_on","heading":"","excerpt":"[[29-df-satisfaction]]","embed":false},{"target":"29-df-bit","status":"resolved","id":"9f2